{"id":"d54f327008e148ac","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-iota-operator.md","title":"Unique Description","display":"df-iota-operator — Unique Description","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-iota-operator","aliases":["90-df-iota-operator"],"display":"df-iota-operator — Unique Description","depends_on":["[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-iota-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-iota-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iota-operator — Unique Description"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(a)\">\\(R(a)\\)</span> 是定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的子集的元语言谓词。唯一描述只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a)\">\\(\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a)\\)</span> 已成立的调用域内使用。</li>\n<li>省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota a\\,R(a)\">\\(\\iota a\\,R(a)\\)</span> 使用调用文件 Hypothesis 已声明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的域；不把描述算子加入算术对象语言，也不给非唯一情形任意默认值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,a)\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\times A:X=\\{a\\}\\},\\\\\n\\iota_A&amp;:\\mathcal P(A)\\rightharpoonup A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\iota_A)&amp;=\\{X\\subseteq A:\\exists!a\\in A\\ (a\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\bigl(\\iota a\\in A\\ R(a)\\bigr)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_A(\\{a\\in A:R(a)\\})\n\\quad(\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a)),\\\\\n(\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a))&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall b\\in A\\ \\bigl[(\\iota a\\in A\\ R(a))=b\\Longleftrightarrow R(b)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,a)\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\times A:X=\\{a\\}\\},\\\\\n\\iota_A&amp;:\\mathcal P(A)\\rightharpoonup A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\iota_A)&amp;=\\{X\\subseteq A:\\exists!a\\in A\\ (a\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\bigl(\\iota a\\in A\\ R(a)\\bigr)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_A(\\{a\\in A:R(a)\\})\n\\quad(\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a)),\\\\\n(\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a))&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall b\\in A\\ \\bigl[(\\iota a\\in A\\ R(a))=b\\Longleftrightarrow R(b)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 表示映射的字母 iota 与本文件的唯一描述函数不是同一接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R(a)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota a\\,R(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_A&\\coloneqq\\{(X,a)\\in\\mathcal P(A)\\times A:X=\\{a\\}\\},\\\\\n\\iota_A&:\\mathcal P(A)\\rightharpoonup A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\iota_A)&=\\{X\\subseteq A:\\exists!a\\in A\\ (a\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\bigl(\\iota a\\in A\\ R(a)\\bigr)&\\coloneqq\\iota_A(\\{a\\in A:R(a)\\})\n\\quad(\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a)),\\\\\n(\\exists!a\\in A\\ R(a))&\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall b\\in A\\ \\bigl[(\\iota a\\in A\\ R(a))=b\\Longleftrightarrow R(b)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1306,"backlinks":[{"id":"f0ea0e26dd8bcf09","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"唯一描述采用 [[90-df-iota-operator]] 的公式／变量模式。对子序对的记法先以单个变量 $z$ 绑定有序对，不使用未定义的多变量描述算子。"},{"id":"80418eede5544150","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\iota$ 直接引用 [[90-df-iota-operator]]，下述公式的全部自由参数为 $s,i$。"},{"id":"a24d8667957b1216","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\iota$ 直接引用 [[90-df-iota-operator]]；$s,m$ 是完整自由参数列。"},{"id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\iota$ 直接采用 [[90-df-iota-operator]] 的公式／绑定变量模式，长度描述式的完整自由参数为 $s$。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}},\\nu_p,(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i$ 是由下式图或分支引入的定义性函数词汇，不是额外待选参数。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-iota-operator]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-base-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-base-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[90-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[90-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[90-df-encoding.md]]\n[[90-df-hilbert-bernays.md]]\n[[90-df-iota-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-language.md]]\n[[90-df-many-one-reducible.md]]\n[[90-df-omega.md]]\n[[90-df-provable.md]]\n[[90-df-relation.md]]\n[[90-df-satisfaction.md]]\n[[90-df-structure.md]]\n[[90-df-substitution.md]]\n[[90-df-term.md]]\n[[90-df-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-halts.md]]\n[[90-df-tm-output.md]]\n[[90-df-turing-machine.md]]\n[[90-df-variable.md]]\n[[90-thm-smn.md]]"}],"outgoing":["4badec96813b3395"]}